OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEastern areas of Wales will be
OL,6,Fsunniest on Monday with western areas
OL,7,Foften much cloudier. Here the cloud
OL,8,Fcould give the odd drizzly outbreak,
OL,9,Fmainly in the northwest. Light winds
OL,10,Fhowever and feeling warm in the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining cloud in the
OL,13,Fnorthwest but clearer in the south.
OL,14,FMist developing under clear skies in
OL,15,Fthe south. A chilly night with grass
OL,16,Ffrost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
