OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloud remains in the north
OL,6,Fbut lifts and breaks through the day.
OL,7,FBrighter in the south with more sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Another warm with temperatures
OL,9,Fabove average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FTurning much wetter in the north on
OL,13,FWednesday with some heavy rain but
OL,14,Fstaying mostly dry further south for
OL,15,Fthe next few days. Temperatures return
OL,16,Fto average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
